          "Guide commanders whose own oracle text classified as draw: Korvold, Fae-Cursed King, The Ur-Dragon, Wilhelt, the Rotcleaver, Sauron, the Dark Lord, and 1 more. Korvold, Fae-Cursed King is a Legendary Creature — Dragon Noble. Printed cost {2}{B}{R}{G}, mana value 5. Its rules text begins “Flying Whenever Korvold enters or attacks, sacrifice another permanent.” The classifiers assign Korvold, Fae-Cursed King the roles draw, sacrifice, counters, combat, threat. The Ur-Dragon is a Legendary Creature — Dragon Avatar. Printed cost {4}{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}, mana value 9. Its rules text begins “Eminence — As long as The Ur-Dragon is in the command zone or on the battlefield, other Dragon spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.” The classifiers assign The Ur-Dragon the roles draw, threat.",
