          "From the scored pool, these share at least one role with Korvold, Fae-Cursed King: Night's Whisper, Phyrexian Arena, Rhystic Study, and Inspiring Call. Night's Whisper is a Sorcery. Printed cost {1}{B}, mana value 2. Its rules text begins “You draw two cards and lose 2 life.” The classifiers assign Night's Whisper the role draw. Phyrexian Arena is a Enchantment. Printed cost {1}{B}{B}, mana value 3. Its rules text begins “At the beginning of your upkeep, you draw a card and lose 1 life.” The classifiers assign Phyrexian Arena the role draw. Rhystic Study is a Enchantment. Printed cost {2}{U}, mana value 3. Its rules text begins “Whenever an opponent casts a spell, you may draw a card unless that player pays {1}.” The classifiers assign Rhystic Study the role draw. Inspiring Call is a Instant. Printed cost {2}{G}. Its rules text begins “Draw a card for each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it.” The classifiers assign Inspiring Call the roles draw, protection, counters.",
